CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"589"},"Documentation":{"$id":"604","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100).","FullInfo":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100).","InfoMap":{"$id":"605","FullIdObj":{"$id":"606","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100).","FullInfo":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100).","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"606"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100).","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Lets you edit the value of configuration key.\r\nThe command performs the following checks and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12300: checks if the Configuration Key exists.\r\n14001: checks if Configuration Key has a Value. \r\n14002: checks if Configuration Key has boolean value (True/False).\r\n14003: checks if Configuration Key has numeric value.\r\n14005: checks if Value has 2 decimal places for NId.\r\n14008: checks if Guid for NId is valid.\r\n14009: checks if support for securing application data is enabled in User Management Console.\r\n14011: checks if the Value field (marked as Protected) has exceeded maximum length (100)."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"607","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"589"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"608","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)","FullInfo":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)","InfoMap":{"$id":"609","FullIdObj":{"$id":"610","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)","FullInfo":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"610"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"589"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(8fcb3d6d-26a2-45b2-a9f1-2e1853b08277)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"SetConfigurationKey","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"SetConfigurationKey"},{"$id":"611","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"612","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"WITH","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"589"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"WITH","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"WITH"},{"$id":"613","$type":"DslCommandPropertyCollectionTree","Name":"InputProperties","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"589"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"ChildrenList":[{"$id":"614","$type":"DslCommandPropertyTree","Children":[{"$id":"615","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Val","FullInfo":"Sieme