r which configuration is being done.\r\nA domain can be integration with third party applications such as integration with Opcenter Laboratory or integration with SIMATIC Batch Integration Layer or any other topic.\r\nThe command performs the following check and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12301: checks if the Domain already exists, using its natural identifier.","FullInfo":"Adds the domain related details, where a domain is a topic for which configuration is being done.\r\nA domain can be integration with third party applications such as integration with Opcenter Laboratory or integration with SIMATIC Batch Integration Layer or any other topic.\r\nThe command performs the following check and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12301: checks if the Domain already exists, using its natural identifier.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"729"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Adds the domain related details, where a domain is a topic for which configuration is being done.\r\nA domain can be integration with third party applications such as integration with Opcenter Laboratory or integration with SIMATIC Batch Integration Layer or any other topic.\r\nThe command performs the following check and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12301: checks if the Domain already exists, using its natural identifier.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Adds the domain related details, where a domain is a topic for which configuration is being done.\r\nA domain can be integration with third party applications such as integration with Opcenter Laboratory or integration with SIMATIC Batch Integration Layer or any other topic.\r\nThe command performs the following check and returns an error accordingly:\r\n12301: checks if the Domain already exists, using its natural identifier."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"730","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","Scri